{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571630/extras/f2d0e3b7fb65f8add3e9cf331fba0776.avif?t=1747438074\" width=604 height=91 /></span><strong>Timeborn</strong> is a <i>JRPG</i> inspired game where you explore a world where time has long since ceased and destroy a variety of powerful foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to rid this world of the <i>void-beings</i> that have began to grow aggressive ever since the <i>Gilded Tower</i> arose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat is a classic <i>turn based</i> system where you are given a wide range of options to take down your foes including <i>stopping time</i> to unleash powerful attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between fights you can explore a variety of environments such as a foggy forest, a dark city, and a clock tower gilded in gold. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The games visuals are <i>2.5d</i> where <i>pixel art, 3d models, and voxel models</i> are used to create a variety of detailed environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Blood Moon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3571630/e538bcfa4e420e1f9c8c264dbb06676f81219220.jpg"},{"name":"The City","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3571630/d91af1616970cfc49c272fcab8c58c8afb1cfc33.jpg"},{"name":"The Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3571630/3ec73c6f86df57ef1615fec93132b8dc78a27434.jpg"},{"name":"God Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3571630/97cb41954dade09df8ca1a92221981730da5579d.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepag